Academic Performance Dashboard

Overview

This Power BI dashboard provides insights into student academic performance through interactive visualizations and analytics.

Features

- GPA Analysis
- Attendance Tracking
- Pass Rate Monitoring
- Department-wise Performance Analysis
- Student Distribution Analysis
- Semester Trend Analysis

Tools Used

- Power BI
- Excel
- Data Visualization

Dashboard Metrics

- Total Students
- Average GPA
- Attendance Percentage
- Pass Rate Percentage

Project Objective

The objective of this dashboard is to help educational institutions monitor student performance, identify trends, and support data-driven decision-making.

